V_{\mathrm{N}}=\bigl(t_{\mathrm{R}}-t_{\mathrm{m}}\bigr)F_{\mathrm{a}}(T/T_{\mathrm{a}})j
$$
$$
\ln(V_{\mathrm{N}})=\ln(R T n_{\mathrm{s}})+\Delta S_{\mathrm{diff}}/R-\Delta H_{\mathrm{diff}}/(R T^{\prime})
$$
